Temporarily expand your mind to force your Gestalt upon your foes in a radius of 5. Up to [1, 2, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] foe(s) will be affected.

The Gestalt will drain each affected foe's powers (physical power, mind power, spell power and steam power) by [25, 34, 41, 47, 52 (TL1-5; MP 100)] for 5 turns.

Your own powers will be increased in return by the drained amount (reduced for each additional foe).

In addition for 5 turns you can sense creatures beyond your sight, even through walls in radius [5, 11, 14, 15, 17 (TL1-5)].

The effects improve with your Mindpower.
